            <ArticleTitle>Impact of postoperative pain on patient experience and recovery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>37-40</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The impact of postoperative pain can be a devastating experience. While there has been a wealth of research to evaluate the effectiveness of pain relief, relatively few studies have considered how pain affects people. A study was therefore undertaken to explore the effect of postoperative pain on patient outcomes following major gynaecological surgery.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
